  Grace Chapel in Heber City
  Q
  Charles Huyck
  • Admin Sep 11 • 0
  a
  )alleytopfiles
  •..
  Many of you have met my life long friend Butch
  Hibbs who lives in Heber City UT. We met in the
  early 90's at a Calvary Chapel in Salt Lake City.
  Over the many years we have been friends we
  have gone to church together, had cookouts
  and dinners together, recreated together, 4
  wheeling, shooting guns, jet skiing, fishing,
  antler hunting, etc.
  Butch is an unwavering man of God and every
  time we have been together for the past 35
  years, or spoken to one another either over the
  phone or in person, our main focus of
  conversation has always been Jesus Christ!
  Butch was at the Turning Point event in Orem
  UT yesterday and had the good fortune of being
  allowed behind the scenes and allowed direct
  contact with Charlie Kirk! How did he get,
  access to Charlie? Butch knows someone.
  •ameone very close to Charlie, like family close!
  Alley Files
  FolloW
  ...
  @alleytopfiles •1h
  Charles Huyck prior worked for DHS and law
  enforcement now Pastor at Grace Chapel
  inn Herber City
  Utah.. He deleted his post from Sept 11/25 of Ch... more
